# Rust build artifacts.
#
# Both workspace members build into the single root target/ directory:
#   - daemon   -> target/release/daemon
#   - firmware -> target/xtensa-esp32s3-none-elf/release/firmware
# So one entry at the root covers every build output.
/target/

# The daemon's virtual-disk backing file (see README "Running the daemon").
# It is created sparse (10 MiB) at runtime when missing and holds user data,
# so it must not be committed.
esb.img

# Editor / IDE noise
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
